  "_comment": "Shared test cases for the rules engine. Both Lorestar/Lorestar_Advisor.lua and web/src/lib/rules.ts must produce these results. Prices are copper per unit. Defaults: ahCut 0.05, ahRatio 1.5, minGainPerItem 2, minListings 3, craftsToKeep 10, saturation 0.25, lowFreeSlots 4, maxSpread 4.",
